<Legal title="Educational Disclaimer" path="/disclaimer" description="IRONFUEL provides educational information only. It is not medical advice.">
  <p>IRONFUEL is a fitness education brand. Please read this disclaimer before using any IRONFUEL website content, Telegram post or guide.</p>

  <h2>Educational information only</h2>
  <p>All IRONFUEL content is general educational information about training, nutrition, supplements, recovery and progress tracking. It is not personalized advice, and it is not a substitute for professional advice, diagnosis or treatment.</p>

  <h2>Not medical advice</h2>
  <p>IRONFUEL does not provide medical, nutritional or other professional advice, and using IRONFUEL content does not create a doctor-patient, coach-client or any other professional relationship.</p>

  <h2>Talk to a professional first</h2>
  <p>Speak with a doctor or another qualified professional before starting or changing an exercise program, changing your diet or taking supplements. This matters most if you have a health condition, an injury, are pregnant or breastfeeding, take medication, or are unsure whether an activity is safe for you.</p>

  <h2>Listen to your body</h2>
  <p>Stop exercising and seek professional advice if you feel pain, dizziness or unwell. Nothing in IRONFUEL content should be used to ignore symptoms or delay getting care.</p>

  <h2>No guarantees</h2>
  <p>Results vary from person to person and depend on training, nutrition, recovery, sleep, health, genetics and consistency. IRONFUEL does not guarantee any result, and any examples are illustrations, not promises.</p>

  <h2>Evidence changes</h2>
  <p>IRONFUEL guides aim to separate evidence, coaching advice and IRONFUEL frameworks. Research evolves, and evidence on many topics is limited or uncertain. Information may become outdated.</p>

  <h2>Supplements</h2>
  <p>Supplements are optional and not required to build muscle. Information about supplements is educational only. It is not a recommendation to take any product.</p>

  <h2>Your responsibility</h2>
  <p>You are responsible for your own decisions and for how you use this information. To the fullest extent permitted by law, IRONFUEL is not liable for any injury, loss or damage arising from your use of, or reliance on, IRONFUEL content.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this disclaimer: <a href={`mailto:${operator.contactEmail}`}>{operator.contactEmail}</a>.</p>
</Legal>
